OpenPocketCine 0.1.5: Media loads complete SD and internal libraries and keeps capacity visible in playback. Redesigned Multiview with a settings panel and cleaner Wi-Fi setup. Long-press to lock exposure, AWB Lock, double-tap to track, joystick sizes and glass pills. Shutter angle stays fixed when FPS changes. Includes LEVEL, experimental Action 6 and lower CPU use. Fixes Live View crashes, video freezes, Nano zoom and clip deletion. Full notes: https://openpocketcine.app/docs/releases/0-1-5/
